"Tank-o-Box" for Windows XP/Vista/7
----------------------------------------------------------------------
 In this arcade combat game, you operate a tank and protect your headquarters from a 
fearsome enemy while enduring 55 intense tank battles that unfold on an imaginary writing 
desk between amusing kid sketches and office stationery. Completing the assignment will not 
be easy because you have to fight off the deadly onslaught of eight different types of tanks 
and armored vehicles that are out to turn your desk into another Stalingrad. Survival 
techniques include taking advantage of the terrain and maneuvering between numerous 
natural and artificial obstacles while lining up your next shot.
----------------------------------------------------[September 2012]--------
